"书籍元信息、个人备注和智能文件夹条件均保存在用户 Mac 的应用沙盒中。高级筛选和智能文件夹只在本机运行，筛选值不会发送至在线检索来源。JSON 备份包含智能文件夹名称与条件，未单独加密，请妥善保管。应用不会将本地书库整体上传到开发者或第三方服务器。" = "Book metadata, personal remarks, and smart collection rules are stored in the app sandbox on your Mac. Advanced searches and smart collections run locally; filter values are not sent to online search providers. JSON backups contain smart collection names and rules and are not separately encrypted; keep them safe. The app does not upload your library to the developer or third-party servers.";
