"仅在点击提取或选择列表中的图书后，应用才向已启用解析器匹配的网址请求页面。网站会收到请求网址、IP 地址和应用版本等网络信息，可能依其政策记录日志。内置豆瓣解析器使用 book.douban.com；自定义 JSON 规则导入前会显示目标网站。导入规则不发出网络请求，规则保存在本机，不运行代码。应用不读取浏览器 Cookie、不登录网站、不上传书库或笔记、不执行网页脚本。来源和时间随书籍保存并包含在书库备份中；自定义规则需单独导出。可在元信息解析器窗口中停用或移除自定义规则。打开浏览器后，适用浏览器和网站自身的设置。" = "The app requests a matching URL only when you click Extract or select a book from a list. Websites receive the URL, IP address, app version, and other network information and may log it under their policies. The built-in Douban translator uses book.douban.com. Custom JSON rules show their target sites before import. Importing rules makes no network request; rules are stored locally and do not run code. The app does not read browser cookies, sign into sites, upload your library or notes, or execute page scripts. Sources and retrieval dates are saved with books and included in backups; export custom rules separately. You can disable or remove custom rules in the Metadata Translators window. When you open a browser, its own settings and the website’s policies apply.";
"仅在点击搜索后，应用将书名或 ISBN 发送至所选来源：豆瓣 www.douban.com、Goodreads www.goodreads.com 或 Open Library openlibrary.org。选择全部来源会分别请求全部已启用来源，停用的解析器不参与。选择候选后读取详情（豆瓣详情来自 book.douban.com）；ISBN 搜索有时直接返回详情。服务方会收到请求内容、IP 地址及应用版本等网络信息，可能按其政策保留日志。本地书库和个人备注不会随请求发送。可以取消任务；已经发出的请求无法撤回。" = "Only when you click Search does the app send the title or ISBN to your selected sources: Douban (www.douban.com), Goodreads (www.goodreads.com), or Open Library (openlibrary.org). Selecting all sources requests each enabled source; disabled translators are excluded. Selecting a result loads its details (Douban details come from book.douban.com); ISBN searches may return details directly. Providers receive the request, IP address, app version, and other network information and may retain logs under their policies. Your library and personal remarks are not sent. You can cancel a task, but requests already sent cannot be recalled.";
