"应用默认每小时在本机保存书籍、笔记和书库关联数据的备份，保留最近 30 份定时与手动备份。升级前备份单独保留最近 10 份。备份包含回收站和可用的恢复草稿，不会上传，也未单独加密。你可以在设置中调整频率、保留份数或关闭定期备份；升级保护始终保留。删除书库条目不会立即从已有历史备份中移除它。" = "By default, the app backs up books, notes, and library relationships locally every hour, keeping the latest 30 scheduled and manual backups. The latest 10 pre-upgrade backups are retained separately. Backups include trash and available recovery drafts; they are not uploaded or separately encrypted. Settings lets you change the frequency and retention or disable scheduled backups; update protection remains enabled. Deleting a library item does not immediately remove it from existing historical backups.";
"开发者不运营接收书库数据的服务器，应用不内置广告或行为分析 SDK。本地书库、个人备注、标签和阅读记录不会自动上传。在线检索涉及的第三方数据处理见下文。" = "The developer does not operate a server that receives your library data. The app contains no advertising or behavioral analytics SDKs. Your local library, personal remarks, tags, and reading records are not automatically uploaded. Third-party processing during online searches is described below.";
