/* Storage privacy clarification */
"书籍、笔记和智能文件夹默认保存在本机应用目录，也可由你选择自定义数据目录。切换目录前先备份，原数据库保留。自动备份和恢复草稿仍保存在本机应用目录。高级筛选和完整性检查只在本机运行，不上传书库内容。数据库与 JSON 备份未单独加密，请妥善保管。" = "Books, notes, and smart collections are stored in the local app directory by default, or in a custom directory you choose. The app backs up the library before changing its location and retains the original database. Automatic backups and recovery drafts stay in the local app directory. Advanced searches and integrity checks run locally without uploading library content. The database and JSON backups are not separately encrypted; keep them secure.";
"导入、导出或添加附件时，应用访问你明确选择的文件或位置。自定义数据目录和附件文件夹的授权保存在本机。选择外部附件文件夹后，新添加的文件存入该文件夹，书库通过软链接访问它们。应用从当前数据库旁的 translators 文件夹加载解析规则。HTML 在本机解析，不执行脚本、不加载引用资源；应用不会扫描其他文件夹。" = "When importing, exporting, or adding attachments, the app accesses the files or locations you choose. Access permissions for custom data and attachment folders are stored on this Mac. If you choose an external attachment folder, newly added files are saved there and accessed through symbolic links in the library. The app loads translator rules from the translators folder beside the current database. HTML is parsed locally without running scripts or loading referenced resources. Other folders are not scanned.";
"选择“Bookshelf → 检查更新…”或同意自动检查后，Sparkle 会从 raw.githubusercontent.com 读取更新清单。下载更新时会访问 GitHub Releases。GitHub 可能收到 IP 地址和应用版本，更新请求不包含书籍、笔记或书库备份。系统分析默认关闭。" = "When you choose Bookshelf → Check for Updates… or allow automatic checks, Sparkle reads the update feed from raw.githubusercontent.com. It downloads updates from GitHub Releases. GitHub may receive your IP address and app version. Update requests exclude books, notes, and library backups. System profiling is off by default.";
"最后更新：2026 年 11 月 16 日" = "Last updated: November 16, 2026";

